  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"></span></b></p></div><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">포화수증기량 수업 할 때 김정식 선생님의 수업 방법을 적용시켜 보았습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">김정식 선생님은</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">포화수증기량</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">최대한 들어올 수 있는 학생 수</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">과 실제 수증기량</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">실제 들어와 있는 학생 수</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">을 이처럼 쉽게 설명하셨더군요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">『</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">교실의 온도만큼 학생이 교실에 들어갈 수 있다고 가정하자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">반 교실 온도가 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">20</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">도라면 최대 몇 명 들어갈 수 있지</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? (20</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">명요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">반 교실 온도가 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">도라면 최대 몇 명 들어갈 수 있지</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? (30</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">명요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">우리 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">반 교실 온도가 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">40</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">도라면 최대 몇 명 들어갈 수 있지</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?(40</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">명요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">…</span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">…』</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">우리학교 수업에서는 살짝 응용하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">처음에는 화이트보드에 온도별 최대 인원수만큼 칸을 그린 다음</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">도미노 칩을 올려놓아 실제 들어와 있는 수를 표현하려고 했습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">근데 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">active</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">한 활동이 낫겠다 싶었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">도우미 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">명</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">피켓걸</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이 각각의 화이트보드에 이렇게 기록합니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">도</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">/4</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">명</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, 20</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">도</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">/6</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">명</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, 30</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">도</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">/8</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">명</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">온도에 따라 최대한 실험대 위에 올라갈 수 있는 인원수입니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">개의 실험대 위에 일단 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">명씩 올라가서 앉습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">미리 체육복 반바지 착용 안내</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)&nbsp; </span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">도에서 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2<